{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BAD1RUpfhc1793744252.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>Facebook母公司Meta，據報計劃發債集資，200億至250億美元。</p><p></p><p>財經頻道《CNBC》報道，Meta發債計劃中三分之二債券會以美元計價，其餘三分之一以歐元計價，資金將用於人工智能基建開支，以及人工智能模型及服務。</p><p></p><p>信貸評級公司標普全球早前才把Meta展望評級由「AA穩定」降至「AA負面」，以反映公司沉重的資本開支及負自由現金流。公司早前公布第三季度業績，料全年資本開支介乎1,350億至1,450億美元，相當於把之前的資本開支預測下限上調50億美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T23:20:58.026966+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":231,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T22:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T12:58:54.369751+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T23:18:22.535695+00:00","content_hash":"689d5422dfa20214a8e00454a75ea53ec097d0b448dc91831172888a2837bcbe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T23:20:58.026966+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}